[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0020","text":"……如果她们能够焕发光辉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0030","text":"肯定，那就算不是在“这里”也——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0040","text":"在283事务所，并不是一定要隶属于某个组合的吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0050","text":"那是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0060","text":"……如果你愿意的话，\n能慢慢说给我听听吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0070","text":"（————……我让他担心了）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0080","text":"（……因为，我没能让大家……开心地为我加油）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0090","text":"——给你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0100","text":"谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0110","text":"────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0120","text":"……刚才那件事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0130","text":"不用特意顾虑我\n真的只是随便问问而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0140","text":"……如果大家要做那样的选择\n我不能成为大家的绊脚石"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0150","text":"…………咲耶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0160","text":"之前说“哪怕是很小的事也请告诉我”那句话\n……我想不只是对我，也是对大家说的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02060000_02_0180","text":"…………怎么可能说得出口啊……"}]
